## 🚀 Getting Started

### Prerequisites

- [.NET 10 SDK](https://dotnet.microsoft.com/download) (Windows)
- Windows OS (uses `System.Windows.Forms` for notifications and `System.Media` for sound)

### Build & Run

```bash
git clone https://github.com/circamanuel/Quartz.git
cd Quartz
dotnet run --project Quartz
```

---

## 🎮 Controls

| Key       | Action                                      |
|-----------|---------------------------------------------|
| `Space`   | Pause / Resume the current timer            |
| `Escape`  | Open quit-session prompt                    |
| `ESC` (Stats view) | Return to main menu                |

