## 💾 Data Storage

Sessions are persisted in JSON format at:

```
%AppData%/Quartz/timeline.json
```

Each session records:
- **ID** — unique GUID
- **Start Date** — when the session began
- **End Date** — when it ended (or was quit)
- **Focus Time** — the configured focus duration in minutes

